meta {
  name: Follows - Post - Get
  type: http
  seq: 165
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a discussion space>/posts/<post cuid>/follow
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The follow state of the current member for a post thread (#1475): `state` (following, muted or stopped; null without a row) and `reason` (wrote, replied or manual). The posts of the list and of the post page carry the same value as `follow_state`. Only a member of the community who can view the space has one (403 otherwise); the marker of a deleted post has none (422). Needs notifications:read.
}
